{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bf42afd-db0e-11ef-9607-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bf42af2-db0e-11ef-899a-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"鮮虞","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鮮虞子","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲜虞子","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b77a7704-db0e-11ef-9deb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮虞縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜虞县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b77a7705-db0e-11ef-b828-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盧奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"卢奴","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b77a7706-db0e-11ef-b8b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b77a7707-db0e-11ef-ac11-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"定州","place_name_jianti_auto":"定州","place_note":"总部设河北省定州市","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b77a7708-db0e-11ef-ae57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鮮虞縣，舊曰盧奴，開皇初更名，以其地春秋鮮虞子之國也；定州治所。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鲜虞县，旧曰卢奴，开皇初更名，以其地春秋鲜虞子之国也；定州治所。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b77a7703-db0e-11ef-b3a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮虞","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜虞","place_note":"定州州政府所在县","resolved_place_entity_id":9961,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b77a770e-db0e-11ef-bdf1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、唐上（卷五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"六年，辅公祏复据丹阳叛，诏赵郡王孝恭以舟师自襄州趣江州[...","context_before":"...亦穷蹙请降。和州总管杜伏威复讨平李子通等，岭海江淮悉定。","source_end_index":1270,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4403012e-c1f8-5346-941e-6c4e9a3d95ad","source_start_index":1211,"source_text":"会刘黑闼复起河北，据窦建德故地，高开道、徐圆朗等亦叛应之。世民讨败黑闼，黑闼北遁，继而复炽，寻败死。圆朗等亦次第夷灭。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/五、唐上（卷五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"39劉黑闥至定州，其故將曹湛、董康買亡命在鮮虞，復聚兵應之。甲午，以淮陽王道玄爲河北道行軍總管以討之。","content_fanyi":"刘黑闼抵达定州，他的旧将曹湛、董康买逃亡在鲜虞，又重新聚集兵马响应他。七月十五日甲午，唐廷任命淮阳王李道玄为河北道行军总管，前往讨伐刘黑闼。","content_jianti_auto":"39刘黑闼至定州，其故将曹湛、董康买亡命在鲜虞，复聚兵应之。甲午，以淮阳王道玄为河北道行军总管以讨之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18354,"number":39,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九十 (唐紀六) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝中之下 / 武德五年 / 第 41 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"b77a7702-db0e-11ef-b62c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":622},"tongjian_id":"b77a7702-db0e-11ef-b62c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"鮮虞"},"message":"success","success":true}